=2 Walkthrough
* Talk to {n:Ratihb} at {p:Aht Urhgan Whitegate} (J-12) at the Shararat Teahouse.
** Note: In the previous quest it was suggested that a final optional step was to go back to Ratihb for a cutscene. If you talk with Ratihb and his response is to welcome you and revitalize with tea, you probably already did that step.
** The quest will not appear in your log until you complete the next step.
* Examine the **???** in {z:Arrapago Reef} (H-10) as Corsair, level 40 or higher, for a cutscene.
** Use the Arrapago Reef Survival Guide to get there quickly.
** If you don't have the Survival Guide you can get it by walking from {z:Nashmau} or take the long way by using the {z:Azouph Isle Staging Point} from {p:Aht Urhgan Whitegate}.
** You will need a {i:Lamian Fang Key|Lamian Fang Key|2219} to get to the **???**.
*** Lamian Fang Keys drop from {p:Lamiae|Category:Lamiae} and {p:Draugers|Category:Skeleton} in the area.
*** You can also receive a Lamian Fang Key from a **???** spot in {z:Caedarva Mire} (I-7) Map 1 (southern part of the block). You can obtain a new key from there once every game day.
** To get to the **???** spot, you must use the Lamian Fang Key on the Iron Gate at (J-10), then go west on the small map to another Iron Gate. (This Iron Gate is unlocked.)
** During the cutscene, you will be asked a question. The correct answer is {z:Maze of Shakhrami}, however it is okay if you guess incorrectly.
* Head to {z:Maze of Shakhrami} Map 2 (K-9). You will find an **Iron Door** in the room in the northwestern corner of (K-9). Examining the door will spawn {m:Lost Soul}.
** The closest warp is the Unity Warp 119 to {z:Buburimu Peninsula} which will put you at the zone line. Take exit H to map 2.
** Next closest is the {z:Abyssea - Attohwa} warp. Then go to (F-6) and and zone into {z:Maze of Shakhrami}. Take exit H to map 2.
** You can also {p:Survival Guide} to {z:Buburimu Peninsula} which is right next to the Abyssea warp.
** Otherwise, starting on Map 1, take exit C to Map 2. Take exit F to Map 1. Take exit H to Map 2.
** You do not need to be a {p:COR} to spawn this NM.
* Defeat the {m:Lost Soul} and check the **Iron Door** again for a cutscene with {n:Imutira} and to obtain a {@k}{k:Wheel lock trigger}.
* Return to the **???** in the {z:Arrapago Reef} for another cutscene.
* Speak to {n:Ratihb}, {p:Aht Urhgan Whitegate} (J-12) for your reward (you may have to speak to him twice).

